140 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 113 0 R
/T (IncidentDesk is a proposed software-based tool that helps small IT teams carry out preliminary security-incident investigation. Users upload supported CSV security logs; the tool extracts events, normalizes timestamps, arranges events chronologically, applies basic rules to flag potentially suspicious patterns, calculates a SHA-256 hash of the evidence file, and generates a structured PDF investigation report. It is expected to make early investigation more organized and manageable.)
/E (IncidentDesk is a proposed software-based tool that helps small IT teams carry out preliminary security-incident investigation. Users upload supported CSV security logs; the tool extracts events, normalizes timestamps, arranges events chronologically, applies basic rules to flag potentially suspicious patterns, calculates a SHA-256 hash of the evidence file, and generates a structured PDF investigation report. It is expected to make early investigation more organized and manageable.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
